43
00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:47.033
Sandali lang.

44
00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:48.601
ano sabi mo

45
00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:51.004
Well, wala.

46
00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:51.871
Paumanhin.

47
00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:02.715
Ito.

48
00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:04.617
- Paumanhin.
- Paumanhin.

49
00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:06.119
